Comment: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,早啊 超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.27,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1031,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真傷腦筋啊
Comment: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然瞞著我們私下串通偷發邀請函
Comment: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,砥信
Comment: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,砥信!
Comment: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過既然妳都來了 那就沒辦法了
Comment: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就好好接受我的招待吧!
Comment: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍微忍耐一下喔
Comment: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,馬上就能見到了
Comment: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能力者們最大的弱點
Comment: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是仍然是人類的血肉之軀
Comment: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這點對妳而言也是一樣
Comment: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算以能力者為對手
Comment: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要全部一起上 就一定能贏
Comment: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確
Comment: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果我是一個人
Comment: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許會非常辛苦
Comment: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在的我不同
Comment: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家一起...
Comment: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和大家一起並肩戰鬥著!!!
Comment: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好厲害
Comment: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這都在預料之中
Comment: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,執行計畫B7
Comment: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓小佐古他們出動!
Comment: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,AB班
Comment: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再撐一下
Comment: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,前方會合的能力者 再一次從左右...
Comment: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 下一個輪到誰?
Comment: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼辦?
Comment: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法和其他人取得聯繫
Comment: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,通信妨礙?
Comment: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然來這招了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎...怎麼辦?
Comment: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也不能對警備機器人下指令了...
Comment: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的...
Comment: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼辦啊...
Comment: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以我說了嘛
Comment: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是我們開發的
Comment: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要是依賴能力的機器人 也不過只有這種程度
Comment: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,本來是想以超電磁砲為對手使用的
Comment: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(930,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,算了
Comment: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒辦法了呢!
Comment: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看起來好像很累啊 超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.63,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1242,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是我們的招待 接下來才是主軸啊
Comment: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這些裝備著解析了學園都市排名第四的能力 製作而成的武器
Comment: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,名字上來說
Comment: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是「模擬原子崩壞」吧
Comment: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.02,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1054,980)}Melt Downer
Comment: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,充分地品嘗一下它的滋味吧
Comment: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春!
Comment: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我沒事
Comment: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天...
Comment: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,後面!
Comment: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,久等了啊
Comment: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們的朋友和我說的 我就帶來了
Comment: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,帶這個來...?
Comment: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和其他會場的聯繫就交給我們吧!
Comment: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,春上!
Comment: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在絆理也在幫忙
Comment: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,正在搭建精神感應者的網路
Comment: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.72,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)}Telepathy
Comment: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就知道會發生這種事
Comment: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.86,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,早就準備好許多對應方法
Comment: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全沒關係的
Comment: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以幫上風紀委員的忙
Comment: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.63,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1020,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像在作夢一樣
Comment: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所謂的「有備無患」
Comment: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是意指這種狀況吧
Comment: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天
Comment: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說明書呢?
Comment: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之 我記在腦海中了
Comment: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大概...
Comment: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 開始了!
Comment: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我婚后航空學園都市第二工廠
Comment: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,投入所有技術製成的
Comment: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可變形式大型汎用作業機器人
Comment: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是什麼鬼啊!?
Comment: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,名為
Comment: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,葉卡捷琳娜二代是也!
Comment: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她是這麼說的
Comment: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不愧是初春
Comment: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天氣勢磅礡呢
Comment: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好!
Comment: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也要更加把勁!
Comment: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好快!
Comment: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,決勝內褲!!!
Comment: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等...佐天!
Comment: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,射擊!
Comment: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什...
Comment: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種東西怎麼能和真貨相比...
Comment: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該死的能力者們
Comment: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把我們崇高的革命...
Comment: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天麻煩妳幫我操控
Comment: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,OK
Comment: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我可是無能力者喔!
Comment: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.81,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1011,980)}Level 0
Comment: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛那個骯髒的光線是什麼鬼啊
Comment: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,死傢伙 老娘有叫你動嗎?
Comment: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和情報所說相同
Comment: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的是在模仿麥野
Comment: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是不要命了~~~
Comment: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超複雜的情況
Comment: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到底是怎麼回事?
Comment: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰知道~呢~
Comment: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最近那些愚蠢的委託都是為了這個嗎?
Comment: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被他們差遣還任意偷走我的數據
Comment: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是丟臉啊!!!
Comment: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超漂亮的
Comment: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麥野
Comment: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛才在那裡...
Comment: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們可沒空去搭理不會記取教訓的小鬼
Comment: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,吶  剛才那是?
Comment: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些人啊
Comment: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可不是好人
Comment: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要快點了喔!
Comment: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.21,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,斑目
Comment: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,小佐古
Comment: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,回答我!
Comment: 0,0:10:58.11,0:10:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,上面也沒有回應...
Comment: 0,0:10:59.11,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,全部被切斷了!
Comment: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還沒!
Comment: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們還沒有輸!
Comment: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你們輸了喔
Comment: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這傢伙!
Comment: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快點停止這一切
Comment: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,解放珍妮
Comment: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,砥信!
Comment: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:14.46,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我依照約定
Comment: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來了唷
Comment: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能力者...
Comment: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又在那邊洋洋得意...
Comment: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有富...
Comment: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...
Comment: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,密碼輸入確認
Comment: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啟動最終階段
Comment: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍妮!
Comment: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,停了?
Comment: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你你你你你...你做什麼...!
Comment: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然真的有...
Comment: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,系統陷入暴走狀態?
Comment: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果強行連接 她就會死
Comment: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什...
Comment: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所謂的最終階段
Comment: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是最後的手段呢
Comment: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把整座學園都市變成廢墟
Comment: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你到底...
Comment: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打算做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你認為
Comment: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會告訴妳嘛?
Comment: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有富!?
Comment: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剩下的時間
Comment: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你們就一邊顫抖恐懼著
Comment: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後死去吧!
Comment: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要啊!
Comment: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又...
Comment: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不行了嗎...
Comment: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要做的事情...
Comment: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總是...
Comment: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想要以死逃避
Comment: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不會讓你這麼輕鬆的
Comment: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明擁有無上的力量
Comment: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻將手伸向更高境界的人
Comment: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,同時
Comment: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也有和你一樣
Comment: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為沒有能力而悲憤
Comment: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不惜偏離正道 也要獲得力量的人
Comment: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,認為自己只是道具
Comment: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,默默地接受自己殘酷命運的人
Comment: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了保護她們
Comment: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,自己死了也沒關係
Comment: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱持著這種想法的蠢蛋
Comment: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是啊
Comment: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管是強大或是弱小
Comment: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,地位高還是地位低 和這些都沒有關係!
Comment: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...和大家約定好了
Comment: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絕對會拯救菲布理
Comment: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,保護這座城市!
Comment: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此
Comment: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也要拯救你
Comment: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要怎麼做才能停止那個最終階段
Comment: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為這樣...
Comment: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,回答我!
Comment: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...
Comment: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對妳...
Comment: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那...那是...
Comment: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你明白的不是嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事到如今已經無法停止了!
Comment: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最終階段就是在學園都市的上空散播五千發絲狀物質
Comment: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓擴散操縱的能力暴走
Comment: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.75,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(837,980)\fscx88}Diffusion Ghost
Comment: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,引發充滿於學園都市中的AIM擴散力場連鎖崩壞
