Comment: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是妳...
Comment: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也絕對無法阻止的!
Comment: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊
Comment: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可能無法阻止
Comment: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,憑我一個人無法阻止
Comment: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,飛彈!?
Comment: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會...
Comment: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請告訴我詳細狀況以及軌道位置
Comment: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是淚子
Comment: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳看 砥信
Comment: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是淚子!
Comment: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我來想辦法
Comment: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍等一下喔
Comment: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在風紀委員中也有很多理科生
Comment: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.84,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(750,980)}Judgment
Comment: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我問問看
Comment: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託妳了
Comment: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...需要我做些什麼...
Comment: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦 菲布理臉好紅啊
Comment: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理 糖果呢?
Comment: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有了...
Comment: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人 剩下的呢?
Comment: 0,0:14:58.55,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是最後一支了
Comment: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會...
Comment: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,交給我吧
Comment: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是能不能做到的問題
Comment: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會成功給妳看的
Comment: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳對我說的...
Comment: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有我才做得到的事情...
Comment: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春?
Comment: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風紀委員的系統
Comment: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.30,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(870,980)}Judgement
Comment: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,別說是迎擊方法了
Comment: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就連它的移動軌道都追蹤不到
Comment: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 這種高規格的機器哪有那麼容易就...
Comment: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事情我聽說了
Comment: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,終於輪到我們出場了呢
