Comment: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說 傳達「愛」這件事呢
Comment: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊...嗯...算是吧...
Comment: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於機體
Comment: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,共計8902處的噴射點
Comment: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以千分之一秒的精度發動
Comment: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后已經設定好了
Comment: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,理論上
Comment: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣應該可行!
Comment: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...在這麼短的時間內 究竟是怎麼完成這麼複雜的計算...
Comment: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有人稍微幫了點忙
Comment: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起 黑子
Comment: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果 竟然讓妳陪我到這種地方
Comment: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在說什麼啊
Comment: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子我啊
Comment: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在 在這裡
Comment: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能被姐姐大人依靠著
Comment: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比什麼事情都驕傲啊
Comment: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,調整頻率完成
Comment: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理 拜託妳了!
Comment: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐~ 是菲布理喔!
Comment: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個啊 是呱太!
Comment: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是菲布理的朋友喔!
Comment: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:51.94,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有啊
