Comment: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.14,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有啊
Comment: 0,0:17:56.35,0:18:00.35,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,我看到了好多東西 知道了很多事情喔
Comment: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託了
Comment: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在才說這些於事無補的話...
