Comment: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,心靈碎片的回禮
Comment: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,心...靈...
Comment: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂的編號是
Comment: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,19090號
Comment: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是那時候的...
Comment: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
