Comment: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多麼地美麗
Comment: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,早安 姐姐
Comment: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,砥信
Comment: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐醒來了喔!
Comment: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是...
