Comment: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍妮
Comment: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了 菲布理
Comment: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是有東西要交給她嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給妳
Comment: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個啊
Comment: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是給姐姐和砥信的
Comment: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是菲布理做的喔!
Comment: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給我...
Comment: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也有...
Comment: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,砥信?
Comment: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也...
Comment: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有很多東西想要給妳們看...
Comment: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,各位久等了
