Comment: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,本年度 學園都市研究發表會即將開始
Comment: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳要好好保重喔
Comment: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 佐天
Comment: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明說好不哭的嘛...
Comment: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,淚子
Comment: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初初
Comment: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要哭喔
