Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:15.48,eff 002,eff,0,0,0,,{\fs30\an7\frz4.377\c&H320B8B&\move(790,596,662,596)}本飛行場為婚后航空所有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:15.48,eff 002,eff,0,0,0,,{\fs30\an7\frz4.377\c&H320B8B&\move(790,640,662,640)}非相關人士 請勿擅自入內
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.41,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很可愛唷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不久之後妳就要自己一個人出去外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.56,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想吃糖的時候就含這個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}記住這個名字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個決定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓這一切開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我這次...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是否能得到正確的答案呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是令人傷腦筋的姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一群不被革命歡迎的客人是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.53,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(870,980)}party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在2萬台搭載型機器人面前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就憑妳們這幾個人能做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓妳久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美偉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太慢了唷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}各位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是怎樣!? 這群人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.83,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}擾亂學園都市秩序的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以及欺負菲布理的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:32.28,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}賭上此臂章的標誌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要因為你們施壓讓警備員屈服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.85,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1170,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就得意忘形起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:43.62,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們就用白井流的說法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們是風紀委員!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:48.43,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1032,980)}Judgement
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美琴?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}各位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好了 放馬過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}身為姐姐大人的先鋒站在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我白井黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是絕對不會讓你們通過的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}交給你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}EF兩班人馬從左右包抄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}J到N班人馬上前對抗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}上了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}衝啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請不要勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是不讓這些傢伙離開會場的範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂會想辦法的!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們要利用對方的程式只能進行簡單的活動這點
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是針對特定目標
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有效地使用戰術
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}水流操作和浮力操作的組合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想對我的朋友出手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再等個一百年吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對不讓你們通過!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了救菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以及
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個還是御坂的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請求!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天的黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和平常完全不一樣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和姐姐大人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}同在啊!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比想像中的還能幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這不過才耗損了2%而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比起這個 超電磁砲在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.13,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(990,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等到找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就讓小佐古他們去擊敗她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}布束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}提高珍妮的活動率
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我好好的控制喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:57.86,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那時候為什麼會告訴菲布理那個人的名字呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為我相信那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}入侵者!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超電磁砲!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:16.77,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(939,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為...為什麼會找到這...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早啊 超電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.27,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1031,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真傷腦筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然瞞著我們私下串通偷發邀請函
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.15,0:04:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過既然妳都來了 那就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就好好接受我的招待吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍微忍耐一下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}馬上就能見到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能力者們最大的弱點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是仍然是人類的血肉之軀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這點對妳而言也是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算以能力者為對手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要全部一起上 就一定能贏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果我是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許會非常辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在的我不同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大家一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和大家一起並肩戰鬥著!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這都在預料之中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}執行計畫B7
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓小佐古他們出動!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}AB班
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再撐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}前方會合的能力者 再一次從左右...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 下一個輪到誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法和其他人取得聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}通信妨礙?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然來這招了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎...怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也不能對警備機器人下指令了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼辦啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以我說了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是我們開發的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要是依賴能力的機器人 也不過只有這種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}本來是想以超電磁砲為對手使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(930,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒辦法了呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看起來好像很累啊 超電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.63,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1242,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是我們的招待 接下來才是主軸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這些裝備著解析了學園都市排名第四的能力 製作而成的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}名字上來說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是「模擬原子崩壞」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.02,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1054,980)}Melt Downer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}充分地品嘗一下它的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}後面!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}久等了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們的朋友和我說的 我就帶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}帶這個來...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和其他會場的聯繫就交給我們吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}春上!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在絆理也在幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}正在搭建精神感應者的網路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.72,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(960,980)}Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就知道會發生這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.86,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早就準備好許多對應方法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}完全沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以幫上風紀委員的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.63,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1020,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好像在作夢一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所謂的「有備無患」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是意指這種狀況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說明書呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總之 我記在腦海中了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大概...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 開始了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我婚后航空學園都市第二工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}投入所有技術製成的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可變形式大型汎用作業機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是什麼鬼啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}名為
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}葉卡捷琳娜二代是也!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不愧是初春
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天氣勢磅礡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也要更加把勁!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好快!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}決勝內褲!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等...佐天!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}射擊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種東西怎麼能和真貨相比...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}該死的能力者們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把我們崇高的革命...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天麻煩妳幫我操控
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我可是無能力者喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.81,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1011,980)}Level 0
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛那個骯髒的光線是什麼鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:10:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}死傢伙 老娘有叫你動嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和情報所說相同
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的是在模仿麥野
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是不要命了~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超複雜的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到底是怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}誰知道~呢~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最近那些愚蠢的委託都是為了這個嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被他們差遣還任意偷走我的數據
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是丟臉啊!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麥野
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛才在那裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們可沒空去搭理不會記取教訓的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}吶  剛才那是?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可不是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要快點了喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}斑目
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}小佐古
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}回答我!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:10:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}上面也沒有回應...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}全部被切斷了!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還沒!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們還沒有輸!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你們輸了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這傢伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快點停止這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}解放珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:14.46,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我依照約定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來了唷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能力者...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又在那邊洋洋得意...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有富...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}密碼輸入確認
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啟動最終階段
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}珍妮!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}停了?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你你你你你...你做什麼...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然真的有...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}系統陷入暴走狀態?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果強行連接 她就會死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所謂的最終階段
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是最後的手段呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把整座學園都市變成廢墟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你到底...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打算做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你認為
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會告訴妳嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有富!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剩下的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你們就一邊顫抖恐懼著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後死去吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不行了嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要做的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想要以死逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不會讓你這麼輕鬆的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明擁有無上的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻將手伸向更高境界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}同時
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也有和你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為沒有能力而悲憤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不惜偏離正道 也要獲得力量的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}認為自己只是道具
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}默默地接受自己殘酷命運的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了保護她們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}自己死了也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱持著這種想法的蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管是強大或是弱小
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}地位高還是地位低 和這些都沒有關係!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...和大家約定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對會拯救菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}保護這座城市!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也要拯救你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要怎麼做才能停止那個最終階段
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}回答我!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那...那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你明白的不是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事到如今已經無法停止了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最終階段就是在學園都市的上空散播五千發絲狀物質
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓擴散操縱的能力暴走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.75,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(837,980)\fscx88}Diffusion Ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}引發充滿於學園都市中的AIM擴散力場連鎖崩壞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發射裝置位於35000公里外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}靜止衛星軌道上作業中的施工設備中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}飛彈已經發射了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以每秒7公里的速度接近學園都市中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}誰也...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也絕對無法阻止的!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可能無法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}憑我一個人無法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}飛彈!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請告訴我詳細狀況以及軌道位置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳看 砥信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是淚子!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我來想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍等一下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在風紀委員中也有很多理科生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.84,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(750,980)}Judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我問問看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...需要我做些什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}咦 菲布理臉好紅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理 糖果呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有了...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人 剩下的呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是最後一支了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是能不能做到的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會成功給妳看的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳對我說的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只有我才做得到的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初春?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風紀委員的系統
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.30,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(870,980)}Judgement
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}別說是迎擊方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就連它的移動軌道都追蹤不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 這種高規格的機器哪有那麼容易就...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事情我聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}終於輪到我們出場了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂在絕妙的時間點登場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}飛彈的彈頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在到達三萬尺高空的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就會分裂成五千發的小彈頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話已經太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們一定要在這之前將它擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而實現這個的唯一辦法是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣就能爭取時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是在那個叫做有富的人所說的地方拿到的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.49,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要從暴走狀態的系統中解放珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}需要菲布理幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在的狀態 已經不接受一切由外部輸入的指令
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是如果是同一原型的菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}向她施加強烈的感情壓力的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是說 傳達「愛」這件事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊...嗯...算是吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對於機體
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}共計8902處的噴射點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}以千分之一秒的精度發動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}婚后已經設定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}理論上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣應該可行!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...在這麼短的時間內 究竟是怎麼完成這麼複雜的計算...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有人稍微幫了點忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起 黑子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}結果 竟然讓妳陪我到這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在 在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能被姐姐大人依靠著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比什麼事情都驕傲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}調整頻率完成
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理 拜託妳了!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐~ 是菲布理喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個啊 是呱太!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是菲布理的朋友喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:51.94,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.67,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}它一直陪在菲布理的身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.14,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:18:00.35,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我看到了好多東西 知道了很多事情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在才說這些於事無補的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}即使如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:17:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一點也好...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}回應她的思念吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}處理速度無法追上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}外部的連接!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂已經開始幫忙並且徵詢著事後同意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是從妳那裡得到的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}心靈碎片的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}心...靈...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂的編號是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}19090號
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是那時候的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}傳達過去了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那兩個人的思考基本程序和御坂們一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們就像是御坂的妹妹們一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.26,0:18:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐救妹妹 需要理由嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂裝成姐姐的樣子理直氣壯的說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也想讓她們知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個世界究竟有多麼耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}多麼地美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早安 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐醒來了喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對了 菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是有東西要交給她嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是給姐姐和砥信的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是菲布理做的喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也有...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}砥信?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有很多東西想要給妳們看...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:20:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在開始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}本年度 學園都市研究發表會即將開始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳要好好保重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的 佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明說好不哭的嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}初初
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要哭喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}珍妮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是護身符喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是獨一無二的唷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要在國外的研究機關針對兩人進行檢查以及再次調整啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.03,0:21:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好不容易大家感情變得這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:45.93,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這已經是出乎意料的寬大處置了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就像是所有的事件紀錄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都被改寫成對我們有利的情況了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...是這樣嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}電子式的紀錄...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}算了 我大概也知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:21:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}甚至感覺到部分人士的記憶也被篡改了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要丟掉自尊啊什麼的這些東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種事情也不是不可能的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大概...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這次就輪到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.89,0:22:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不再是一個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.92,0:23:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}走吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在回去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還趕得上下午的課
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們去哪裡買個午餐吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.12,0:23:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會無聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要有姐姐大人在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要有御坂在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等...等...這是什麼意思!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}廣域社會參觀學習的東西已經準備好了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是明天了啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.58,0:23:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學藝都市啊~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好期待喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 等等 剛剛說那句話到底是什麼意思啦~~~!?
