Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:31.02,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}自然に　通じ合う想い　無邪気な笑顔咲かせた
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:35.70,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}手を伸ばし　抱きしめた
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.03,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}色鮮やかな現実は
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:42.46,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}誰一人　壊せない
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:46.11,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}いつだって　ずっと信じてるから
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:47.79,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}For shining truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:53.07,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}もしいつか　戸惑い　心が震えても
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:56.36,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}迷いなく　手を繋ぎ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:16:01.87,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}駆け出すよ　強い絆がここにあるから!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.61,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}Try anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:08.75,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}煌いた　光の欠片を集めたら
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:12.03,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}果てしない　大空に
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:15.86,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}解き放つ　君に　伝えたい言葉
