Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:35.06,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}響き合う　願いが今、覚醒めてく
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.88,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}譲れない未来のために
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:41.93,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}巡り逢う　運命を越えたその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:46.83,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}この想い輝くから
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:54.02,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}ここじゃない未来に想い託してみては
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:18:01.02,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}強さの本当の意味を探し続けてた
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:07.94,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}ありのままの痛みを受け入れるその意味を
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:13.99,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}明日へ走り続ける君に知った
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:18.10,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}憧れは　能力を今　呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:20.87,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}守りたいものがあるから
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:24.90,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}巡りゆく　景色胸に　駆け上がるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.72,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}痛みは風に消えてく
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.05,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}Believe in Judgelight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:31.87,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}運命さえ　撃ち抜いて
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:34.48,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}夜明けをこの手で造ろう
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:38.73,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}変えていく勇気と変わらない心で
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:42.19,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}I Believe myself and precious emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.19,0:18:45.82,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}打ち砕く　この想いで
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:07.83,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}始まりの　光の中　誓い合う
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.74,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}果てなき闇を裁くこと
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:14.88,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}恐れてた　孤独の渦　溺れることに
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.68,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}だけどもう振り向かない
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:18.99,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}Just truth in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:21.74,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}いつだって迷わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.55,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}消せない想いがあるから
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:28.67,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}解き明かす　真実から　瞳を逸らさずに
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:31.98,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}I'll reach the next stage to realize all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:36.75,SED-JP,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}確かな絆信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:35.06,SED-CH,,0,0,0,fx,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}敲響共鳴 願望在此刻、覺醒
